{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_04_end",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_04",
  "title": "他是將軍",
  "storyCode": "OF-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "325b1d527998cd8bd6c7180b56f202158ed8665b882757079264c8c501fd58f0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_hotel"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個菲林族女性並非泛泛之輩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這還是難不倒你的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "將軍，沒受傷吧？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必擔心。她的部下都只是些庸人。你們安全之後，撤退對我來說還算輕鬆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只不過，關於這個保鏢的身份，我有些猜測。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "身份",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "難道說......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哥倫比亞，菲林族，女性，銀髮、金瞳、黑弩。是殺手，也是傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殺手聞名於諸城是件可恥的事，但這些傳聞實在是過於有名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "譬如說，毀掉一整個哥倫比亞家族。一個強盛的家族，重要人物在數年內陸續暴斃，逐漸走向衰落，最終徹底被除名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再如，獵殺一整支巡邏隊。這支巡邏隊在哥倫比亞邊境燒殺搶掠，自詡野蠻人的征服者，不斷地向異族施加暴行和慘劇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之後的一個月內，他們在山間逃竄，不斷死去，最後只剩下一個殘廢回到城市胡言亂語。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及向我敘說故事的人的遭遇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "又發生了什麼？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "請說吧，我不害怕。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必多說了。他的傷疤從左肩延伸到右腳後跟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殺人如麻的傢伙比比皆是，我也如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，這個殺手失蹤已久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，如果她就是那個人，那麼擺在我們面前的，自然是腥風血雨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "水比想像中的深。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "錫蘭被蒙在鼓裡？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許市長並非不知情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不如說，如果她是市長的殺手，我不會感到奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "（玻璃杯粉碎）"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "錫蘭？！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你從什麼時候......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "錫蘭小姐，你不用躲著偷聽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我，我想給你們倒杯水......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫拉格爺爺，那個傭兵，是從什麼時候開始活動，又是在什麼時候失蹤的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的事蹟開始聞名，甚至在我還未退伍之時。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而她銷聲匿跡則是一年之前，隨著那個家族的覆滅一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......直到六年前，黑都在維多利亞照顧我的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是有一天，她忽然說爸爸需要她回去做事，就走了，只在每年耶誕節的時候來接我回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但、但是，她剛才只是態度不好，而且聽了別人的命令，黑她怎麼可能是那種殺人如麻的殺手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，按照你們的說法，你們想說克洛寧的背後是我爸爸在授意嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不信！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不作推測。但我也說過，即使是最信任的人，也未必對你毫無保留。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信與不信，我不關心。只是，她身上的烏薩斯制式武器留下的傷痕，我絕不會看錯。這支隊伍被埋葬在大雪中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現狀如你所見，博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果火山的情報處理也有市政府參與，那麼這件事我們未必應該插手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "錫蘭小姐，你也應該看清事實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "錫蘭",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我需要冷靜一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，請。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "啊？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我是該做些什麼吧？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerId": "char_188_helage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自然。現在她需要一個能夠理解她的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
